          "id": "df3208c15b0a73162e670ac4aeae6609b691fcea",
          "message": "bench(reason-el): real-ontology EL classification vs ELK harness + pinned smoke (sq-hmd7l.8) [FABLE-5] (#1950)\n\nsparq-reason-el's only bench was synthetic (snomed_go_scale_bench). Add the durable\nsame-box comparison vs ELK (the reference OWL 2 EL classifier) on real ontologies\n(GO / OpenGALEN), with a subsumption-count ORACLE recorded BEFORE any timing.\n\n- crates/sparq-reason-el/examples/reason_el_real_bench.rs: classifies an ontology file\n  end-to-end and reports proper named subsumption pairs (complete closure). Two modes:\n  --smoke (assert the pinned vendored-fixture count) and gather (<path> [format], print\n  count+time for the GO/OpenGALEN cross-check). No required-features; runs identically in\n  feature-OFF and --features rbox (fixture uses role-equality existentials only).\n- crates/sparq-reason-el/examples/data/el_smoke.ttl: small VENDORED hermetic EL+bottom\n  fixture; pins 6 lattice classes / 9 proper named subsumptions, including a CR4\n  existential edge OWL 2 RL cannot reach (non-vacuous: a regression drops the count 9->8).\n- scripts/bench/reason-el-same-box.sh: --smoke acceptance path (sparq-only, no net/JVM) +\n  full gather (OWL->NT via riot, sparq vs ELK, counts+agreement recorded, honest ERROR\n  degradation, ONE competitor-results envelope per ontology). NEITHER engine is ground\n  truth; a disagreement is recorded, never adjusted. All rows NON-canonical on a shared box.\n- research/gap-reason-el-2026-07.md: methodology + provenance (NON-canonical flagged).\n- bench/benchmarks.toml: fill the reason-el-real registry stub with the delivered artifacts.\n\nGates: clippy -D warnings (default + --all-features, all-targets), tests both states,\nrustdoc --all-features -D warnings, check-new-bench-registered + check-no-perf-numbers PASS.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-11T16:51:37Z",
